    LLM: 'Game: Taroki Polish, call XIX. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Taroki z dziewiÄ™tnastkÄ… (Taroki call XIX) is a Polish tarot game played around Zabrzeg and Czechowice-Dziedzice. Four players; partner is chosen by calling the XIX (19) tarokk. Similar to Czech Taroky. Uses 54-card pack with 22 trumps. Descended from Austrian Tarock variants when the region was part of Austrian Galicia and Silesia.',
